&lt;strong&gt;Were you actually speaking/moving your mouth&lt;/strong&gt; when &lt;code&gt;TALKING · BREATH HELD&lt;/code&gt; showed up, or did it trigger while you were quiet? &lt;em&gt;(If SmartSpectra flickers &lt;code&gt;talking=true&lt;/code&gt; on a single noisy frame at rest, freezing breath at &lt;code&gt;55%&lt;/code&gt; will lock out the &lt;code&gt;60%&lt;/code&gt; reveal—we should require a few consecutive frames before engaging the talking guard.)&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Notice you immediately had to ask &lt;em&gt;"what am I doing on this page?"&lt;/em&gt;—a judge will feel the exact same friction on &lt;code&gt;/experience&lt;/code&gt;. Want me to add a compact 1-line gesture guide bar (&lt;code&gt;Look L/C/R to focus · Breathe steadily to sharpen · Blink after 4.2s to cut&lt;/code&gt;) right on &lt;code&gt;/experience&lt;/code&gt; and check if &lt;code&gt;face.talking&lt;/code&gt; needs smoothing after you test it?&lt;/li&gt;
