&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Short, unfiltered verdict:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Apart from the missing video, is this post worthy of &lt;em&gt;absolutely&lt;/em&gt; winning right now?&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;No.&lt;/strong&gt; It is a solid top-15–20 entry in a field that jumped overnight to &lt;strong&gt;100+ submissions&lt;/strong&gt;, not a lock for one of the 10 winner slots.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Is it better than your winning Week 4 project (&lt;em&gt;Ghost Visitors&lt;/em&gt;) and its write-up?&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;No — not yet.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Ghost Visitors&lt;/em&gt; had sharper writing, stronger empirical verification, honest limits, and zero factual errors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Here is the exact deep-research audit behind that verdict — including &lt;strong&gt;one factual error in our current post and app that a Presage engineer judge would catch immediately.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-25-1-critical-factual-mistake-caught-in-our-draft--ui-presage-74"&gt;1. Critical Factual Mistake Caught in Our Draft &amp;amp; UI (Presage §7.4)&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Our current draft (&lt;code&gt;dev_submission_draft.md&lt;/code&gt;) and &lt;code&gt;CalibratePage.tsx&lt;/code&gt; claim:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;"Leaving &lt;code&gt;cardioMetrics&lt;/code&gt; OFF avoids triggering Presage's automatic Presage → Anthropic LLM Insights cloud pipeline described in §7.4 of Presage's Telemetry &amp;amp; Privacy policy."&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;That claim is contradicted by Presage's own documentation and SDK source:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
- Presage's live &lt;a href="https://smartspectra.presagetech.com/docs/llm-insights" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;LLM Insights documentation&lt;/a&gt; states:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;"Auto-fired vitals — once a session is running, the SDK automatically dispatches vitals snapshots of the accumulated metrics buffer: one the first time pulse rate has a stable reading, **one when breathing rate does&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;, one when HRV does, and then **one every 60 seconds for as long as the session runs.&lt;/em&gt;* ... The buffered metric values — an allowlisted subset of the computed metrics (&lt;strong&gt;pulse rate, heart-rate variability, and breathing rate&lt;/strong&gt;) as a columnar series."*&lt;br&gt;
- Presage Privacy Policy &lt;strong&gt;§7.4&lt;/strong&gt; states:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;em&gt;"Insights are generated automatically during SDK sessions and cannot currently be turned off by Developers or End Users."&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;
- And in &lt;code&gt;node_modules/@smartspectra/node-sdk/js/smartspectra.js&lt;/code&gt; (lines 386–398), the Node SDK &lt;strong&gt;unconditionally registers &lt;code&gt;onInsight&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; on every session. Because AFTERIMAGE requests &lt;code&gt;breathingMetrics&lt;/code&gt; by default (emitting &lt;code&gt;308&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;breathing.rate&lt;/code&gt; readings in &lt;code&gt;sample-trace.json&lt;/code&gt;), we &lt;strong&gt;cannot&lt;/strong&gt; truthfully claim that leaving &lt;code&gt;cardioMetrics&lt;/code&gt; off guarantees nothing hits Presage's §7.4 Anthropic pipeline without a packet capture proving it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Compare how two top &lt;code&gt;#presagechallenge&lt;/code&gt; competitors handled this exact fact:&lt;br&gt;
- &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/emediongrgb/witness-camera-vitals-that-show-their-work-1b73"&gt;Witness&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; Read the SDK 3.5.0 source, noticed it always registers an insight sink, and stated plainly: &lt;em&gt;"Until then I state what the code shows, not what I observed on the wire."&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;
- &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/iszee23/senti-draw-the-tension-you-planned-see-the-tension-your-player-felt-1261"&gt;Senti&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; Disclosed cleanly: &lt;em&gt;"Per Presage's documentation, it may also send short derived number summaries (never video) for an LLM wellness feature that apps cannot switch off. Senti does not request, show or store those insights."&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Because Presage engineers participate directly in final judging, leaving an inaccurate §7.4 guarantee in our Consent section is a serious vulnerability.&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-25-2-what-the-100-entry-field-actually-looks-like-today-nov-22"&gt;2. What the 100+ Entry Field Actually Looks Like Today (Nov 22)&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Yesterday there were ~30 entries. Today there are &lt;strong&gt;100+ &lt;code&gt;#presagechallenge&lt;/code&gt; submissions&lt;/strong&gt; competing for &lt;strong&gt;10 total prizes&lt;/strong&gt; (4 Overall, 3 Most Creative, 3 Best Thoughtful Real-World). Your real competition now includes:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative / Experimental Track (your real lane):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
- &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/faris-khan/upbeat-a-choir-that-comes-in-on-your-breath-32i4"&gt;Upbeat&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;code&gt;faris-khan&lt;/code&gt;): Virtual choir for conductors that predicts a downbeat from the &lt;strong&gt;first 150 ms&lt;/strong&gt; of the SmartSpectra inhale slope, schedules voices within &lt;code&gt;0.021 ms&lt;/code&gt; on the WebAudio clock, and has &lt;strong&gt;70 unit tests&lt;/strong&gt; + deterministic replay.&lt;br&gt;
- &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/timothy_akanbi/long-exposure-a-daguerreotype-that-takes-a-minute-because-the-sdk-does-113l"&gt;Long Exposure&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;code&gt;timothy_akanbi&lt;/code&gt;): &lt;strong&gt;Same darkroom / photographic plate metaphor as AFTERIMAGE&lt;/strong&gt;, WebGL silver-plate shader, &lt;strong&gt;56 unit tests + CI&lt;/strong&gt;, real TCP network audit table, and an animated GIF at the top of the post.&lt;br&gt;
- &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/khozhijon/breathblown-a-glass-studio-where-your-breathing-blows-the-vase-2d8l"&gt;Breathblown&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;code&gt;khozhijon&lt;/code&gt;): Desktop glassblowing studio sculpting molten glass ring-by-ring from &lt;code&gt;breathing.upperTrace&lt;/code&gt; with wall-clock playout buffering and &lt;strong&gt;25 unit tests&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;
- &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/iszee23/senti-draw-the-tension-you-planned-see-the-tension-your-player-felt-1261"&gt;Senti&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;code&gt;iszee23&lt;/code&gt;): Game-playtest tension curve vs. planned curve, pre-registered startle test (11 spikes vs. 1 in calm), committed evidence traces.&lt;br&gt;
- &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/emilpz320a11y/commit-pulse-git-commits-stamped-with-your-heartbeat-and-a-map-of-the-files-that-raise-it-4n6i"&gt;Commit Pulse&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;code&gt;emilpz320a11y&lt;/code&gt;): Git &lt;code&gt;prepare-commit-msg&lt;/code&gt; hook stamping heart rate onto commits and mapping which folders raise your pulse.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thoughtful Real-World Track (why AFTERIMAGE shouldn't dilute itself chasing this track):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
- &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/jonathansolvesstuff/unskipped-see-where-your-beta-reader-stopped-caring-as-page-flags-in-your-own-manuscript-4j6c"&gt;Unskipped&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Validated against a real &lt;strong&gt;fingertip pulse oximeter&lt;/strong&gt; (29/29 readings within 5 bpm), exports real Word/Google Docs comments, &lt;code&gt;npm run check&lt;/code&gt; fails if any blog post number disagrees with committed traces, and the author contacted the Quebec Writers' Federation.&lt;br&gt;
- &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/aryan_anand_0713/trustfall-i-crash-tested-smartspectras-stable-flag-with-one-minute-of-my-face-35i3"&gt;TrustFall&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Metamorphic crash-testing across &lt;strong&gt;17 SDK sessions / 988 half-second readings&lt;/strong&gt; proving a 2% light flicker fools &lt;code&gt;stable&lt;/code&gt; 62/62 times.&lt;br&gt;
- &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/mzee04/twenty-a-shared-pause-when-a-conversation-runs-hot-209n"&gt;Twenty&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;code&gt;mzee04&lt;/code&gt;, your Week 4 Overall Winner), &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/samarth_kumble_a91ad88634/practical-a-webcam-physiology-lab-that-grades-itself-against-a-wrist-count-3adp"&gt;Practical&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/tushar_shah/preppulse-a-pressure-map-for-exam-practice-built-on-smartspectra-265g"&gt;PrepPulse&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/gavin_rose/onblink-communicate-with-minimal-movement-3ag3"&gt;OnBlink&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (an actual AAC communicator for non-speaking users with labeled key-press blink evals).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Notice the pattern across &lt;em&gt;Upbeat&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Long Exposure&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Breathblown&lt;/em&gt;: &lt;strong&gt;all three entered ONLY &lt;code&gt;Most Creative or Delightful Use&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt; Entering &lt;code&gt;Best Thoughtful Real-World Use&lt;/code&gt; with a "calm-tech hands-free reading" pitch puts AFTERIMAGE directly against oximeter-validated studies and real disability AAC tools—which makes the post feel stretched rather than focused.&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-25-3-direct-comparison-current-afterimage-vs-your-winning-week-4-post-ghost-visitors"&gt;3. Direct Comparison: Current AFTERIMAGE vs. Your Winning Week 4 Post (&lt;em&gt;Ghost Visitors&lt;/em&gt;)&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;div class="table-wrapper-paragraph"&gt;&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Area&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Ghost Visitors&lt;/em&gt; (Week 4 Winner)&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Current &lt;em&gt;AFTERIMAGE&lt;/em&gt; Draft (&lt;code&gt;5088430&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Gap&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governing Hook &amp;amp; Voice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
