&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-25-4-what-is-strong-enough-to-win-if-we-close-those-gaps"&gt;4. What &lt;em&gt;Is&lt;/em&gt; Strong Enough to Win (If We Close Those Gaps)&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You shouldn't panic or scrap anything—the underlying build has real advantages that &lt;em&gt;Long Exposure&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Witness&lt;/em&gt;, and most of the 100 entries don't have:&lt;br&gt;
- &lt;strong&gt;You solved the exact blink + landmark problem &lt;em&gt;Long Exposure&lt;/em&gt; couldn't solve&lt;/strong&gt; (478 isotropic pixel landmarks &lt;code&gt;[316..564, 10..350]&lt;/code&gt; → scale-invariant EAR blink-on-reopen &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt; 650 ms&lt;/code&gt; vs. &lt;code&gt;1.1 s&lt;/code&gt; pause + &lt;code&gt;4.2 s&lt;/code&gt; Shutter Armed lock, paired with additive iris/yaw gaze and OLS-detrended chest breath).&lt;br&gt;
- &lt;strong&gt;Sitting 1 vs. Sitting 2 Contact Sheets (&lt;code&gt;contact-sheet-run1-center-locked.png&lt;/code&gt; vs. &lt;code&gt;contact-sheet-sample.png&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/strong&gt; are authentic visual before/after engineering proof—the same DNA that made &lt;code&gt;report.png&lt;/code&gt; vs. &lt;code&gt;whispers.png&lt;/code&gt; work in &lt;em&gt;Ghost Visitors&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;br&gt;
- &lt;strong&gt;Your cover (&lt;code&gt;presage-7.jpg&lt;/code&gt;) and 5-plate Contact Sheet artifact&lt;/strong&gt; stand out visually in a feed full of dark neon dashboards.&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-25-5-exact-checklist-to-bring-afterimage-above-ghost-visitors-before-publishing"&gt;5. Exact Checklist to Bring AFTERIMAGE Above &lt;em&gt;Ghost Visitors&lt;/em&gt; Before Publishing&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Fix the §7.4 factual error&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;code&gt;CalibratePage.tsx&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;README.md&lt;/code&gt;, and the DEV draft so it states accurately that &lt;code&gt;breathing.rate&lt;/code&gt; is in the SDK's auto-fired §7.4 buffer (cannot currently be disabled by developers), &lt;code&gt;cardioMetrics&lt;/code&gt; stays OFF by default so pulse/HRV are never computed or buffered, &lt;code&gt;enableTelemetry: false&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;requestInsight()&lt;/code&gt; is never called.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Replace the &lt;code&gt;Keyboard Interactive&lt;/code&gt; screenshots&lt;/strong&gt; with honest captures from &lt;strong&gt;Recorded Sample Trace&lt;/strong&gt; (or your live bridge) and label them explicitly, so no judge sees &lt;code&gt;Keyboard Interactive&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;Preview&lt;/code&gt; contradicting the caption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Add &lt;code&gt;npm run verify-trace&lt;/code&gt; + expand tests + add &lt;code&gt;.github/workflows/ci.yml&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; so every number cited in the post (&lt;code&gt;366&lt;/code&gt; frames, &lt;code&gt;91 / 235 / 40&lt;/code&gt; L/C/R, &lt;code&gt;63.9%&lt;/code&gt; trace avg vs. &lt;code&gt;63%&lt;/code&gt; 5-plate average, &lt;code&gt;26&lt;/code&gt; raw blinks → &lt;code&gt;15&lt;/code&gt; armed cuts, &lt;code&gt;308&lt;/code&gt; breath rates) is deterministically verified on every push—matching &lt;em&gt;Ghost Visitors&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;Unskipped&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Tighten the DEV post into true &lt;em&gt;Ghost Visitors&lt;/em&gt; prose:&lt;/strong&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead with one clear rule (&lt;strong&gt;"A blink is a cut, not a click."&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compress the 8 dense findings into 4–5 crisp, human-voiced lessons tied directly to Sitting 1 → Sitting 2 (and move full low-level SDK reference notes into &lt;code&gt;docs/SDK-NOTES.md&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
