&lt;li&gt;Focus &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;## Prize Categories&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; squarely on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;Most Creative or Delightful Use&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (plus Overall) instead of diluting it with &lt;code&gt;Best Thoughtful Real-World Use&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove the &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;!-- BEFORE PUBLISHING --&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; comment (keeping only the video slot until you upload).&lt;/li&gt;
