&lt;strong&gt;Record a real 60–90 s live webcam demo video WITH AUDIO&lt;/strong&gt; showing consent → live silhouette → L/C/R gaze shift → early blink ripple (&lt;code&gt;&amp;lt; 4.2 s&lt;/code&gt;) → armed blink cut (&lt;code&gt;&amp;gt; 4.2 s&lt;/code&gt;) → calm breath developing the cobalt marginalia → exported Contact Sheet PNG.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Say the word and I'll execute items 1–4 cleanly right now (fix §7.4 in code/README/draft, add &lt;code&gt;verify-trace&lt;/code&gt; + expanded tests + GitHub Actions CI, recapture clean Sample Trace screenshots, rewrite the draft to beat &lt;em&gt;Ghost Visitors&lt;/em&gt;, push, and redeploy Vercel).&lt;/p&gt;

