&lt;li&gt;Updated &lt;code&gt;useSignals.ts&lt;/code&gt; so hosted Vercel sessions automatically boot into &lt;strong&gt;Recorded Sample Trace&lt;/strong&gt; mode (&lt;code&gt;Sample Trace&lt;/code&gt;) when &lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="agent-session-redacted"&gt;[REDACTED]&lt;/span&gt;:4199&lt;/code&gt; is absent, while local runs still auto-switch to the live Native Bridge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-27-2-recaptured-honest-sample-trace-screenshots"&gt;2. Recaptured Honest &lt;code&gt;Sample Trace&lt;/code&gt; Screenshots&lt;/h3&gt;

