&lt;p&gt;All Sitting 3 code, asset, documentation, CI, Vercel deployment, and DEV draft updates are complete and verified.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-31-1-code--regression-fix-42-ms-eyelid-descent-race"&gt;1. Code &amp;amp; Regression Fix (&lt;code&gt;42 ms&lt;/code&gt; Eyelid-Descent Race)&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated &lt;code&gt;bridge/signal-processor.mjs&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;SignalProcessor.process&lt;/code&gt; to add &lt;code&gt;nativeBlinkEarFloor = 0.25&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;code&gt;nativeEarClear&lt;/code&gt;), suppressing SmartSpectra's native &lt;code&gt;face.blinking&lt;/code&gt; pulse while eyelids are already descending below &lt;code&gt;0.25&lt;/code&gt; EAR without breaking partial-blink fallback at &lt;code&gt;0.28&lt;/code&gt; EAR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added Regression Test #21 in &lt;code&gt;bridge/signal-processor.test.mjs&lt;/code&gt; replaying the real Sitting 3 telemetry sequence (&lt;code&gt;289.913 s&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;ear = 0.321&lt;/code&gt; → &lt;code&gt;289.947 s&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;ear = 0.213&lt;/code&gt; + &lt;code&gt;blinking: true&lt;/code&gt; → &lt;code&gt;289.989 s&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;ear = 0.175&lt;/code&gt; → &lt;code&gt;291.114 s&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;longBlinkPause&lt;/code&gt; → &lt;code&gt;292.424 s&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;ear = 0.253&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-31-2-sitting-3-assets-screenshots--deterministic-verifier"&gt;2. Sitting 3 Assets, Screenshots &amp;amp; Deterministic Verifier&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
