&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Verdict: Do not build &lt;code&gt;HUSH_PLAN.md&lt;/code&gt; as written.&lt;/strong&gt; Between your Nov 6 planning date and today (Nov 17), an entrant already shipped an Electron horror game literally named &lt;strong&gt;"Hush: a horror game that hunts you by your own heartbeat"&lt;/strong&gt;, alongside three other horror/blink-statue games, AND your plan's consent/privacy disclosures violate Presage's current SDK privacy policy while several planned signal mechanics break against &lt;code&gt;@smartspectra/node-sdk&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;3.5.0&lt;/code&gt; behavior.&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;h2 id="agent-session-1410-1-1-idea--live-competition-audit-critical-failure"&gt;1. Idea &amp;amp; Live Competition Audit (CRITICAL FAILURE)&lt;/h2&gt;

