&lt;td&gt;Relying on Discord manual help during the final weekend (Nov 21–22) is fragile; keep live SDK dev runs short and use mock &lt;code&gt;BodyState&lt;/code&gt; for UI/game tuning.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
