&lt;p&gt;Nothing is blocking the backend anymore — the repo, native SDK, Windows camera discovery, verification harness, and interactive UI mockups are all built, verified, and pushed to &lt;code&gt;main&lt;/code&gt; on &lt;a href="https://github.com/emarc99/presage-dev" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;emarc99/presage-dev&lt;/a&gt;. Only &lt;strong&gt;two gates&lt;/strong&gt; stand between now and building the live app:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Your Presage API key:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;SMARTSPECTRA_API_KEY&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;PRESAGE_API_KEY&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;PRESAGE_SMARTSPECTRA_API_KEY&lt;/code&gt; are currently unset on this machine, so &lt;code&gt;npm run spike&lt;/code&gt; stops cleanly with setup instructions until you copy &lt;code&gt;.env.example&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;.env&lt;/code&gt; with your key.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
