&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-5-3-pick-your-ui-direction-before-frontend-build"&gt;3. Pick Your UI Direction Before Frontend Build&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Open &lt;code&gt;afterimage_ui_mockups.html&lt;/code&gt; (or &lt;code&gt;mockups/index.html&lt;/code&gt; in a browser). Every direction lets you switch across all 3 screens (&lt;strong&gt;Consent &amp;amp; 478-Point Silhouette Setup&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Live Memory Canvas&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Developed Contact Sheet&lt;/strong&gt;) and test interactive &lt;code&gt;Trigger Blink (Cut)&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Gaze L/C/R&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Breath Steadiness&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;Tonal Echo&lt;/code&gt; controls:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Direction A — &lt;code&gt;35mm Silver-Halide Darkroom&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; Obsidian darkroom, safelight amber (&lt;code&gt;#d9822b&lt;/code&gt;), top 35mm sprocket strip with live amber blink-cut notches, optical haze clearing as breath steadies. Strongest dark-room photographic metaphor; high contrast for webcam viewing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Direction B — &lt;code&gt;Cyanotype Sun-Print&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; Prussian indigo blueprint plates with sun-bleached ivory and cyan exposure luminescence (&lt;code&gt;#7fd1e8&lt;/code&gt;) + crisp photographic exposure meter. Feels poetic and technical without dark-mode clichés.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Direction C — &lt;code&gt;Editorial Linen &amp;amp; Sumi Ink&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; Daylight archival cotton paper (&lt;code&gt;#f3efe6&lt;/code&gt;), sumi ink, and vermilion shutter seal (&lt;code&gt;#b84a32&lt;/code&gt;). Highest literary legibility and distinct from dark-themed contest entries, though less dramatic in dim rooms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


