&lt;p&gt;You're already on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;/experience&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (Step 3 — &lt;strong&gt;Scene I of V&lt;/strong&gt;), and your live SmartSpectra webcam &lt;strong&gt;is actively streaming&lt;/strong&gt; right now (&lt;code&gt;55%&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;TALKING · BREATH HELD&lt;/code&gt; only come from the live bridge).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-13-what-to-do-on-this-page-experience"&gt;What to Do on This Page (&lt;code&gt;/experience&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There are &lt;strong&gt;3 physical interactions&lt;/strong&gt; (hands off the keyboard):&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Breathe steadily (&lt;code&gt;55%&lt;/code&gt; → &lt;code&gt;≥ 60%&lt;/code&gt;) to clear the blur &amp;amp; unlock the hidden line:&lt;/strong&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep your mouth still/quiet for ~2 seconds so &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;TALKING · BREATH HELD&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; clears (while that badge is active, your breath meter intentionally freezes at &lt;code&gt;55%&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sit back slightly so your upper chest is in view and take &lt;strong&gt;2–3 slow, even breaths&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Once the badge crosses &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;≥ 60%&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;code&gt;FOCUS SHARP&lt;/code&gt;), the illustration sharpens, a soft chime rings, and &lt;code&gt;"Hold steady breathing..."&lt;/code&gt; transforms into the hidden italic marginalia line.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Shift your eyes Left / Center / Right:&lt;/strong&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Glance &lt;strong&gt;left&lt;/strong&gt; (venetian blinds), &lt;strong&gt;center&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;code&gt;FOCUS: Ceramic Cup&lt;/code&gt;), or &lt;strong&gt;right&lt;/strong&gt; (folded napkin note). The spotlight frame, parallax, caption, and stereo audio shift to follow your gaze.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Blink once to advance (&lt;code&gt;SHUTTER ARMED · BLINK TO CUT&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/strong&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Because the &lt;code&gt;4.2 s&lt;/code&gt; dwell lock is already armed, give &lt;strong&gt;one normal blink&lt;/strong&gt; to trigger the eyelid shutter cut (&lt;code&gt;Beat 1/3 → 2/3 → 3/3 → Scene II → ... → Scene V → Contact Sheet&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holding your eyes shut for &lt;strong&gt;~1.2 s&lt;/strong&gt; toggles &lt;code&gt;PAUSED (LONG BLINK)&lt;/code&gt; without cutting. &lt;em&gt;(Pressing &lt;code&gt;Space&lt;/code&gt; or clicking &lt;code&gt;Blink Cut · Space&lt;/code&gt; also advances anytime.)&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-13-if-you-meant-to-do-step-1-first-pulse-toggle-test--recording"&gt;If You Meant to Do Step 1 First (Pulse Toggle Test + Recording)&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Click &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;Calibrate&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; in the top navigation bar to open &lt;code&gt;/calibrate&lt;/code&gt;. That's where:&lt;br&gt;
- &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;Optional Optical Pulse (cardioMetrics)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; switch lives (to test live BPM with the §7.4 disclosure), and&lt;br&gt;
- &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;Record Sitting&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; button lives (click it right before clicking &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;Enter Scene I →&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; so your sitting gets saved to &lt;code&gt;web/public/sample-trace.json&lt;/code&gt; when you finish on &lt;code&gt;/contact-sheet&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;


