&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Right now, the draft only embeds &lt;code&gt;contact-sheet-sample.png&lt;/code&gt;. A judge reading the post never sees the &lt;strong&gt;Darkroom Calibration room (&lt;code&gt;/calibrate&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/strong&gt; with the live landmark silhouette and §7.4 pulse toggle, or an &lt;strong&gt;active Triptych Scene (&lt;code&gt;/experience&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/strong&gt; with the breathing SVG art, L/C/R spotlight, and &lt;code&gt;SHUTTER ARMED — BLINK TO CUT&lt;/code&gt; pill.&lt;/li&gt;
