&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-25-4-what-is-strong-enough-to-win-if-we-close-those-gaps"&gt;4. What &lt;em&gt;Is&lt;/em&gt; Strong Enough to Win (If We Close Those Gaps)&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You shouldn't panic or scrap anything—the underlying build has real advantages that &lt;em&gt;Long Exposure&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Witness&lt;/em&gt;, and most of the 100 entries don't have:&lt;br&gt;
