&lt;p&gt;All five upgrades from the audit are implemented, verified, pushed to &lt;code&gt;origin/main&lt;/code&gt;, live on Vercel, green in GitHub Actions CI, and updated on your DEV draft (&lt;code&gt;id: 5088430&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;published: false&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;ai_disclosure_level: "some_ai"&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-27-1-fixed-presage-74-privacy-claim--sample-trace-default"&gt;1. Fixed Presage §7.4 Privacy Claim &amp;amp; Sample Trace Default&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Corrected the inaccurate §7.4 wording across &lt;code&gt;CalibratePage.tsx&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;OverviewPage.tsx&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;SessionContext.tsx&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;bridge/server.mjs&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;spike/camera-spike.mjs&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;README.md&lt;/code&gt;, and the DEV post: &lt;code&gt;cardioMetrics&lt;/code&gt; stays OFF by default so pulse/HRV are never computed or buffered, &lt;code&gt;enableTelemetry: false&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;requestInsight()&lt;/code&gt; is never called, and because &lt;code&gt;breathing.rate&lt;/code&gt; is in the SDK's allowlisted vitals buffer, Presage's §7.4 auto-fired summaries cannot currently be disabled by developers—disclosed upfront on &lt;code&gt;/calibrate&lt;/code&gt; and in Consent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated &lt;code&gt;useSignals.ts&lt;/code&gt; so hosted Vercel sessions automatically boot into &lt;strong&gt;Recorded Sample Trace&lt;/strong&gt; mode (&lt;code&gt;Sample Trace&lt;/code&gt;) when &lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="agent-session-redacted"&gt;[REDACTED]&lt;/span&gt;:4199&lt;/code&gt; is absent, while local runs still auto-switch to the live Native Bridge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-27-2-recaptured-honest-sample-trace-screenshots"&gt;2. Recaptured Honest &lt;code&gt;Sample Trace&lt;/code&gt; Screenshots&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
