&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-27-3-deterministic-trace-verifier-20-unit-tests-ci--engineering-notes"&gt;3. Deterministic Trace Verifier, 20 Unit Tests, CI &amp;amp; Engineering Notes&lt;/h3&gt;

