- &lt;strong&gt;Updated sample trace:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;sample-trace.json&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;code&gt;670&lt;/code&gt; keyframes — currently dirty in git, so &lt;code&gt;npm run verify-trace&lt;/code&gt; will stay red until we either adopt Sitting 3 or revert)&lt;br&gt;
- &lt;strong&gt;Monograph Contact Sheet (4:25 PM):&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;afterimage-contact-sheet (3).png&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;code&gt;239.2 s&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;15&lt;/code&gt; cuts, &lt;code&gt;72%&lt;/code&gt; clarity, &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;AVG PULSE 75.4 BPM (§7.4)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;br&gt;
- &lt;strong&gt;Solar Coral Contact Sheet (4:09 PM):&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;afterimage-contact-sheet (2).png&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;code&gt;194.7 s&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;15&lt;/code&gt; cuts, &lt;code&gt;57%&lt;/code&gt; clarity)&lt;br&gt;
- &lt;strong&gt;Raw video capture:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;Screen Recording 2026-11-22 162606.mp4&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;code&gt;17m 54s&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;1.05 GB&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;191 kbps&lt;/code&gt; audio)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This sitting is &lt;strong&gt;much stronger&lt;/strong&gt; for the submission post than Sitting 2 — it eliminates one of our biggest Honest Limits and caught one real hardware edge case straight from your 30 Hz data.&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-29-1-what-sitting-3-proves-live-that-sitting-2-couldnt"&gt;1. What Sitting 3 Proves Live (That Sitting 2 Couldn't)&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Every single signal in the app fired live on your face in one continuous recording:&lt;/strong&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Live speech-artifact guard (&lt;code&gt;face.talking&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/strong&gt; Because you narrated the demo, Sitting 3 logged &lt;strong&gt;15 distinct speaking episodes&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;code&gt;822&lt;/code&gt; 30 Hz packets / &lt;code&gt;57&lt;/code&gt; sample-trace frames). Across all &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;807&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; consecutive talking-frame checks, &lt;code&gt;breathSteadiness&lt;/code&gt; stayed locked with &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;0&lt;/code&gt; violations (&lt;code&gt;807 / 807&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/strong&gt;. That completely removes our old &lt;em&gt;"Silent reading trace (&lt;code&gt;talking: 0&lt;/code&gt;)"&lt;/em&gt; caveat from &lt;code&gt;### Honest Limits&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Live opt-in pulse (&lt;code&gt;cardioMetrics&lt;/code&gt;) + honest &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt; 40%&lt;/code&gt; confidence gating:&lt;/strong&gt; Once you toggled pulse ON (&lt;code&gt;t = 264.6 s&lt;/code&gt;), SmartSpectra delivered &lt;code&gt;1,223&lt;/code&gt; valid readings (&lt;code&gt;67.5–85.5 bpm&lt;/code&gt;, mean &lt;code&gt;76.7 bpm&lt;/code&gt;). On &lt;code&gt;afterimage-contact-sheet (3).png&lt;/code&gt;, Plates II–IV show &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;71.8&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;77.1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;77.2 bpm&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;code&gt;75.4 bpm&lt;/code&gt; avg), while &lt;strong&gt;Plate I&lt;/strong&gt; (pre-toggle / warmup) and &lt;strong&gt;Plate V&lt;/strong&gt; (looking far left where rPPG confidence dropped &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt; 40%&lt;/code&gt;) honestly show &lt;strong&gt;no pulse (&lt;code&gt;null&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/strong&gt; instead of printing junk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Live &lt;code&gt;longBlinkPause&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;code&gt;&amp;gt;= 1.1 s&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;4&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; real long-blink pauses triggered (&lt;code&gt;157.86 s&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;259.14 s&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;291.11 s&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;320.69 s&lt;/code&gt;), with live &lt;code&gt;ear&lt;/code&gt; spanning &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;0.115&lt;/code&gt; (closed) to &lt;code&gt;0.420&lt;/code&gt; (open)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Richer 3-zone gaze &amp;amp; dwell gating:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;171&lt;/code&gt; Left / &lt;code&gt;406&lt;/code&gt; Center / &lt;code&gt;93&lt;/code&gt; Right&lt;/strong&gt; keyframes (&lt;code&gt;gazeScalar&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;0.280–0.668&lt;/code&gt;) with Plates II, III, and IV each showing &lt;strong&gt;all three colors (gray / blue / coral)&lt;/strong&gt; on the gaze bar; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;64&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; reopen blinks (&lt;code&gt;34&lt;/code&gt; passed the &lt;code&gt;4.2 s&lt;/code&gt; dwell gate / &lt;code&gt;30&lt;/code&gt; early reading blinks suppressed across the full &lt;code&gt;352.4 s&lt;/code&gt; log; &lt;code&gt;15&lt;/code&gt; cut the &lt;code&gt;239.2 s&lt;/code&gt; five-plate sitting); &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;523&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;breathRate&lt;/code&gt; readings (mean &lt;code&gt;16.0 br/min&lt;/code&gt;, steadiness &lt;code&gt;45–89%&lt;/code&gt;, mean &lt;code&gt;72.4%&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Your demo video, Contact Sheet, and hosted Vercel replay can now all be the exact same sitting.&lt;/strong&gt; A judge who watches your video and clicks Vercel literally replays the sitting they just watched.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-29-2-two-real-engineering-findings-caught-in-your-new-logs"&gt;2. Two Real Engineering Findings Caught in Your New Logs&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;A real 40 ms &lt;code&gt;face.blinking&lt;/code&gt; descent race during Long-Blink Pause #3 (&lt;code&gt;dt = 289.95 s&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/strong&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On 3 of your 4 long-blink pauses (&lt;code&gt;157.86 s&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;259.14 s&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;320.69 s&lt;/code&gt;), zero &lt;code&gt;blinkCut&lt;/code&gt; fired.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On pause #3 (&lt;code&gt;dt = 291.11 s&lt;/code&gt;), SmartSpectra's native &lt;code&gt;face.blinking&lt;/code&gt; flag fired at &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;dt = 289.95 s&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; while your eyelids were still descending at &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;ear = 0.213&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; — &lt;strong&gt;40 ms before&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;ear&lt;/code&gt; crossed &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt; 0.21&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;code&gt;0.175&lt;/code&gt; at &lt;code&gt;289.99 s&lt;/code&gt;) for a 2.39-second deliberate pause! Because &lt;code&gt;wasLowEar&lt;/code&gt; was still &lt;code&gt;false&lt;/code&gt;, native &lt;code&gt;face.blinking&lt;/code&gt; slipped a &lt;code&gt;blinkCut&lt;/code&gt; through right before the pause.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Fix &amp;amp; Story Value:&lt;/strong&gt; Suppressing native &lt;code&gt;face.blinking&lt;/code&gt; whenever full 468-point landmarks are active (or while &lt;code&gt;ear &amp;lt; 0.25&lt;/code&gt;) + adding &lt;strong&gt;Test #21&lt;/strong&gt; built straight from that &lt;code&gt;289.95 s&lt;/code&gt; frame fixes it cleanly — and writing &lt;em&gt;"My demo recording caught one more bug (the 40 ms eyelid-descent race)"&lt;/em&gt; is pure &lt;em&gt;Ghost Visitors&lt;/em&gt; engineering proof.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Honest dashed flatlines on your Solar Coral sheet (&lt;code&gt;afterimage-contact-sheet (2).png&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/strong&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plates II–IV show dashed flatlines (&lt;code&gt;0/3 hidden notes&lt;/code&gt;) where chest waves dropped out, while Plate I and Plate V draw real emerald waves (&lt;code&gt;2/3 hidden notes&lt;/code&gt; on Plate V) — visual proof that the Contact Sheet never fakes missing curves, while also showcasing the dark &lt;strong&gt;Solar Coral&lt;/strong&gt; theme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-29-3-critical-note-on-your-raw-video-17m-54s-105-gb"&gt;3. Critical Note on Your Raw Video (&lt;code&gt;17m 54s&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;1.05 GB&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;Screen Recording 2026-11-22 162606.mp4&lt;/code&gt; is &lt;strong&gt;17 minutes 54 seconds&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;code&gt;1.05 GB&lt;/code&gt;). Judges won't watch an 18-minute unedited capture — trim it down to &lt;strong&gt;90–120 seconds&lt;/strong&gt; covering the single cleanest continuous stretch from Sitting 3 (consent + §7.4 → live silhouette → gaze L/C/R, talking hold, steady breath chime, early blink ripple + armed blink cut, long-blink pause, opt-in pulse → Contact Sheet export) before uploading to YouTube.&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;h3 id="agent-session-1410-29-want-me-to-apply-these-upgrades-to-the-repo-vercel-and-dev-draft-5088430-now"&gt;Want me to apply these upgrades to the repo, Vercel, and DEV draft (&lt;code&gt;5088430&lt;/code&gt;) now?&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix the &lt;strong&gt;40 ms &lt;code&gt;face.blinking&lt;/code&gt; descent race&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;code&gt;bridge/signal-processor.mjs&lt;/code&gt; + add &lt;strong&gt;Test #21&lt;/strong&gt; from the real &lt;code&gt;289.95 s&lt;/code&gt; telemetry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adopt &lt;strong&gt;Sitting 3&lt;/strong&gt; as &lt;code&gt;sample-trace.json&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;code&gt;670&lt;/code&gt; frames) and &lt;code&gt;contact-sheet-sample.png&lt;/code&gt; (your new &lt;code&gt;239.2 s&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;75.4 bpm&lt;/code&gt; Monograph print), plus update &lt;code&gt;scripts/verify-trace.mjs&lt;/code&gt; to assert all Sitting 3 numbers (&lt;code&gt;670&lt;/code&gt; frames, &lt;code&gt;57&lt;/code&gt; talking frames, &lt;code&gt;81&lt;/code&gt; pulse frames, &lt;code&gt;171 / 406 / 93&lt;/code&gt; L/C/R, &lt;code&gt;64&lt;/code&gt; blinks → &lt;code&gt;34&lt;/code&gt; armed / &lt;code&gt;30&lt;/code&gt; early).&lt;/li&gt;
