&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Notes:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Hydration safety.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;now&lt;/code&gt; starts as &lt;code&gt;null&lt;/code&gt;, so the server HTML and the first client render match ("Loading…"). The real time is set in &lt;code&gt;useEffect&lt;/code&gt;. If you compute the time during render, you get a hydration mismatch warning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;30-second tick.&lt;/strong&gt; We show minutes, so a 1-second interval only wastes battery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Accessibility.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;aria-live="polite"&lt;/code&gt; lets screen readers announce the next-prayer line. The Arabic names get &lt;code&gt;lang="ar"&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;dir="rtl"&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The English description from &lt;code&gt;translations.en&lt;/code&gt; is shown as a tooltip. Swap it for &lt;code&gt;ur&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;ar&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;id&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;ms&lt;/code&gt; to localise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


